Subject: [PATCH 1/2] arm64: dts: qcom: Add device tree for Samsung Galaxy Book
 S

Signed-off-by: Anton Bambura <jenneron@protonmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Davis Morrison <davis.m112@protonmail.com>
